rica.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs16\fs28\super\insrsid1728776\charrsid11828039 \chftn {\footnote \ltrpar \pard\plain \ltrpar\s15\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20\alang1025 
